From c3215332967e02197446b9cf1126db42559e6e40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tolewis <tim@tolewis.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 17:21:47 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] sage xpu: fp16 MoE kernels in the qwen27 image set, first
 Sage runner (MLX 4/64, decode kernels, not yet compiled)

---
 zig/build/xpu.zig           |   3 +-
 zig/kernels/xpu/sage_moe.cl |  30 +-
 zig/src/xpu/kernels.zig     |   3 +-
 zig/src/xpu/sage.zig        | 541 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 560 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 zig/src/xpu/sage.zig

